---
layout: base.njk
title: Booking & Operations Glossary for Service Businesses
metaDescription: "Plain-language definitions of multi-branch booking, double booking, daily reconciliation, discount approval workflows and other terms service businesses in Nepal use."
dateModified: "2026-10-01"
bodyClass: page--light-nav
---
{% from "schema/breadcrumb.njk" import breadcrumbSchema with context %}
{{ breadcrumbSchema([{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "Glossary", url: "/glossary/" }]) }}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "DefinedTermSet",
  "@id": "{{ site.url }}/glossary/#termset",
  "name": "Zennly booking and operations glossary",
  "url": "{{ site.url }}/glossary/",
  "dateModified": "{{ dateModified }}",
  "publisher": { "@id": "{{ site.url }}/#organization" },
  "hasDefinedTerm": [
    {% for t in glossary %}{
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "{{ site.url }}/glossary/#{{ t.slug }}",
      "name": {{ t.term | dump | safe }},
      "description": {{ t.definition | dump | safe }},
      "url": "{{ site.url }}/glossary/#{{ t.slug }}",
      "inDefinedTermSet": "{{ site.url }}/glossary/#termset"
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

<main>

  <section class="section" style="padding-bottom:0; padding-top:calc(var(--v2-nav-h) + var(--v2-nav-inset) + var(--space-lg));">
    <div class="article-hero" style="padding:0 0 var(--space-sm); text-align:left; max-width:var(--max-w-copy); margin:0 auto;">
      <p class="article-hero__eyebrow article-hero__eyebrow--pill">Glossary</p>
      <h1 class="article-hero__h1" style="margin-top:var(--space-sm);">Booking &amp; operations glossary</h1>
      <p class="article-hero__meta">Last updated: October 1, 2026</p>
    </div>
    <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid var(--color-border); max-width:var(--max-w-copy); margin:var(--space-lg) auto;" />
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="article-body reveal">
      <p>Plain-language definitions of the terms spas, salons, gyms and clinics in Nepal run into when choosing booking software.</p>
      {% for t in glossary %}
      <h2 id="{{ t.slug }}">{{ t.term }}</h2>
      <p>{{ t.definition }}</p>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bottom-cta" id="demo">
    <div class="bottom-cta__card bottom-cta__card--banner reveal">
      <h2 class="bottom-cta__h2">See these ideas in a live system.</h2>
      <p class="bottom-cta__sub">Book a 20-minute demo and we&rsquo;ll show you how Zennly handles them.</p>
      <a href="/demo" class="bottom-cta__banner-btn">Book your demo &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "_footer-v2.njk" %}

</main>
